{"id":"n77748-1-7","stage":3,"title":"짖다 · 吠","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77748-1-7-1","ko":"저도 강아지 키우고 싶어요. 엄마.","zh":"我也很想养小狗，妈妈。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저도","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"강아지","meaning":"小狗，狗崽","explanation":"강아지：小狗，狗崽","readings":[{"term":"강아지","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15689","senseId":"1","lemma":"강아지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"키우고","meaning":"养","explanation":"키우다：养；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"키우다","audio":"/audio/cff5458b4f7fee672311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66587","senseId":"2","lemma":"키우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싶어요.","meaning":"要，想","explanation":"싶다：要，想；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62657","senseId":"1","lemma":"싶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엄마.","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"94e82412553f09dd","term":"강아지","zh":"小狗，狗崽","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3","entryId":"15689","definition":"狗的崽子。","pronunciation":["강아지"]},{"id":"cff5458b4f7fee67","term":"키우다","zh":"养","audio":"/audio/cff5458b4f7fee672311.mp3","entryId":"66587","definition":"照料动植物而使其成长。","pronunciation":["키우다"]},{"id":"b3ad33de22cbca64","term":"싶다","zh":"要，想","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3","entryId":"62657","definition":